# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
#
# LOTA systemd preset: enable the enforcement daemon and the continuous
# attestation loop by default on install.
# `systemctl preset` (and packaging %systemd_post) honour this so deployed
# host enforces and attests fire-and-forget without the operator enabling
# units by hand.
# lota-attest.service still gates itself on a completed first enrollment
# via its ConditionPathExists.
#
# Copyright (C) 2026 Szymon Wilczek
enable lota-agent.service
enable lota-attest.service
